   "alt": "Two panels. Left, convergence: five separate devices and industries, radio, television, camera, newspaper and telephone, each have an arrow pointing into one smartphone. Right, content integration: three pieces of content, a video, a map and guest reviews, each have an arrow pointing into one tourism website, which shows all three on the same page.",
   "caption": "Convergence is about devices and industries merging into one; content integration is about combining content from different sources into one product.",
