  {
   "screen": "Characteristics of successful adopters",
   "title": "Figure 1.4.2 · Six characteristics of successful adopters",
   "alt": "A central circle labelled successful adopter is linked to six boxes. Strategic planning: clear goals for digital media. Audience awareness: who, where, what they need. Content consistency: regular, on-brand posting. Data-informed decisions: analytics guide changes. Ethical practices: honest advertising, permission to use content, privacy protection. Adaptable workflows: change tools as platforms shift. A bar along the bottom reads: supported by leadership and staff training.",
   "caption": "Learn the six names, then link each one to evidence in a scenario: what the organisation does that shows it.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 360\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><line x1=\"218\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"253.5\" y2=\"120\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"14\" width=\"212\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"42.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Strategic planning</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">clear goals first</text><line x1=\"218\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"253.5\" y2=\"150\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"106\" width=\"212\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"134.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Audience awareness</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">who, where, what they need</text><line x1=\"218\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"253.5\" y2=\"180\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"198\" width=\"212\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"226.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Content consistency</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">regular, on-brand posts</text><line x1=\"422\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"386.5\" y2=\"120\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"422\" y=\"14\" width=\"212\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"528\" y=\"41.7\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Data-informed decisions</text><text x=\"528\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">analytics guide changes</text><line x1=\"422\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"386.5\" y2=\"150\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"422\" y=\"106\" width=\"212\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"528\" y=\"134.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Ethical practices</text><text x=\"528\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">honesty, permission, privacy</text><line x1=\"422\" y1=\"236\" x2=\"386.5\" y2=\"180\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"422\" y=\"198\" width=\"212\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"528\" y=\"226.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Adaptable workflows</text><text x=\"528\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">adapt as platforms shift</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"150\" r=\"72\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Successful</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">adopter</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"300\" width=\"520\" height=\"46\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"328.2\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Supported by leadership and staff training</text><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"320\" y2=\"300\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Disruption: when industries fail to adapt",
   "title": "Figure 1.4.3 · Industries disrupted, and the way to survive",
   "alt": "Four rows show an older industry on the left and what took its place on the right: video rental shops gave way to streaming services; print newspapers and magazines lost advertising to online platforms; music retail, CDs and physical shops, gave way to downloads and streaming; travel agencies now compete with online booking platforms. A box below explains that disruption is not always the end: businesses that adapt add what platforms cannot easily offer, namely local knowledge, personal service, trusted relationships and specialist packages.",
   "caption": "Pair every disrupted industry with what replaced it, then show how a business could adapt, for example a travel agent selling island-hopping packages over WhatsApp.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 390\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M1U4-3-aink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"130\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Old way</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Challenged or replaced by</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"36\" width=\"240\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"63.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Video rental shops</text><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"59\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"59\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-aink)\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">lost ground to</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"36\" width=\"250\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"505\" y=\"63.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Streaming services</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"94\" width=\"240\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"113.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"130\">Print newspapers and</tspan><tspan x=\"130\" dy=\"17.1\">magazines</tspan></text><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"117\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"117\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-aink)\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">lost ground to</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"94\" width=\"250\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"505\" y=\"113.4\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"505\">Online platforms (ads move</tspan><tspan x=\"505\" dy=\"17.1\">online)</tspan></text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"152\" width=\"240\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"179.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Music retail: CDs and shops</text><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"175\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-aink)\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">lost ground to</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"152\" width=\"250\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"505\" y=\"179.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Downloads and streaming</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"210\" width=\"240\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"237.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Travel agencies</text><line x1=\"256\" y1=\"233\" x2=\"374\" y2=\"233\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-aink)\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">lost ground to</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"210\" width=\"250\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"505\" y=\"237.9\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Online booking platforms</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"278\" width=\"620\" height=\"100\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Disruption is not always the end. Businesses that adapt add what</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"321\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">big platforms cannot easily offer:</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"330\" width=\"142\" height=\"44\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-surface s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"356.7\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Local knowledge</text><rect x=\"174\" y=\"330\" width=\"142\" height=\"44\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-surface s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"245\" y=\"356.7\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Personal service</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"330\" width=\"142\" height=\"44\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-surface s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"395\" y=\"348.5\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"395\">Trusted</tspan><tspan x=\"395\" dy=\"16.5\">relationships</tspan></text><rect x=\"474\" y=\"330\" width=\"142\" height=\"44\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-surface s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"545\" y=\"348.5\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"545\">Specialist</tspan><tspan x=\"545\" dy=\"16.5\">packages</tspan></text></svg>"
  }
