  {
   "screen": "Personas, segments and prosumers",
   "title": "Figure 2.1.2 · A user persona and the four ways to segment an audience",
   "alt": "A persona card for Keisha, 17, a Lower Six student in Belmopan. She uses TikTok and YouTube daily on her phone, studies with short videos, dislikes long text and slow sites, wants to pass CAPE with Grade One, and is frustrated that her data runs out before the end of the month. Callouts link parts of the card to the four segmentation bases: demographic (age 17, student), geographic (Belmopan), behavioural (platforms and device used daily) and psychographic (her goal and values). Below, a scale shows three levels of participation: consumer, who watches, reads or listens but does not create; prosumer, who both consumes and produces; creator, who produces content regularly, often for an audience or income.",
   "caption": "A persona turns a segment into a believable person. Notice how each detail on the card comes from one of the four segmentation bases.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 470\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M2U1-2-agold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"360\" height=\"316\" rx=\"14\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"58\" r=\"34\" class=\"f-soft\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"44.4\" r=\"10.3\" class=\"f-gold\"/><path d=\"M40.8,83.5 v-11.4 q0,-13.9 17.2,-13.9 q17.2,0 17.2,13.9 v11.4 z\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\">Keisha, 17</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"14\">Lower Six student</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"93\" font-size=\"14\">Belmopan, Belize</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"116\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"116\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Uses</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\">TikTok and YouTube daily</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"149\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Device</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"169\" font-size=\"14\">her phone, for everything</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"182\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"182\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Studies</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"14\">with short videos</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"215\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"215\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Dislikes</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"14\">long text, slow sites</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"248\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Goal</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"14\">pass CAPE with Grade One</text><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"281\" x2=\"356\" y2=\"281\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"301\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Frustration</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"301\" font-size=\"14\">data runs out by month end</text><rect x=\"430\" y=\"20\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Demographic</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">age, income, occupation</text><path d=\"M430,51 L380,70\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"70\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><rect x=\"430\" y=\"98\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Geographic</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">where they live</text><path d=\"M430,129 L380,89\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"89\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><rect x=\"430\" y=\"176\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Behavioural</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">devices, habits, buying</text><path d=\"M430,207 L380,150\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"150\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><rect x=\"430\" y=\"254\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"530\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Psychographic</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">values, interests, lifestyle</text><path d=\"M430,285 L380,264\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"264\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">How actively users take part</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"376\" width=\"196\" height=\"84\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"108\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Consumer</text><text x=\"108\" y=\"428.5\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"108\">watches, reads or</tspan><tspan x=\"108\" dy=\"16.5\">listens; does not create</tspan></text><line x1=\"207\" y1=\"418\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"418\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U1-2-agold)\"/><rect x=\"222\" y=\"376\" width=\"196\" height=\"84\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Prosumer</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"428.5\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"320\">both consumes and</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"16.5\">produces</tspan></text><line x1=\"419\" y1=\"418\" x2=\"433\" y2=\"418\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U1-2-agold)\"/><rect x=\"434\" y=\"376\" width=\"196\" height=\"84\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"532\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Creator</text><text x=\"532\" y=\"428.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"532\">produces regularly, often</tspan><tspan x=\"532\" dy=\"15.9\">for an audience or income</tspan></text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Digital immigrants and a symbiotic relationship",
   "title": "Figure 2.1.3 · Natives and immigrants learning from each other",
   "alt": "Two people face each other. On the left, a student, a digital native: tech savvy, multitasking, a collaborative communicator and a visual learner. On the right, a grandparent, a digital immigrant: values tradition, focuses on quality and has problem-solving skills built over years. An arrow from the student to the grandparent reads: shows how to video-call relatives in New York. An arrow back from the grandparent to the student reads: shares how to check a story before believing it. In the centre: collaboration and a diversity of perspectives.",
   "caption": "The relationship is symbiotic: each side gives something the other needs. That is why good media teams mix ages.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 340\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M2U1-3-agold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"150\" r=\"70\" class=\"f-softb\"/><circle cx=\"530\" cy=\"150\" r=\"70\" class=\"f-softb\"/><circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"116\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-gold\"/><path d=\"M80,184 v-19.8 q0,-24.2 30,-24.2 q30,0 30,24.2 v19.8 z\" class=\"f-gold\"/><circle cx=\"530\" cy=\"116\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-muted\"/><path d=\"M500,184 v-19.8 q0,-24.2 30,-24.2 q30,0 30,24.2 v19.8 z\" class=\"f-muted\"/><path d=\"M514,104 q16,-12 32,0\" class=\"f-none s-ink\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M190,96 Q320,22 450,96\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U1-3-agold)\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Shows how to video-call relatives in New York</text><path d=\"M450,206 Q320,280 190,206\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U1-3-agold)\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Shares how to check a story before believing it</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"118\" width=\"160\" height=\"64\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"137.8\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"320\">Collaboration</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"17.1\">and diverse</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"17.1\">perspectives</tspan></text><text x=\"110\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Digital native</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"15\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Digital immigrant</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">tech savvy, multitasking,</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"328\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">visual, collaborative</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">values tradition, quality,</text><text x=\"530\" y=\"328\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">experienced problem-solving</text></svg>"
  }
