  {
   "screen": "The elements of a proposal (a) to (f)",
   "title": "Figure 2.7.3 · Turning a weak objective into a SMART one",
   "alt": "At the top, a weak objective is crossed out: make students aware of the library. It has no measure and no deadline. Below, the SMART objective is split into four parts, each labelled. By 30 November 2026: time-bound. Produce three 60-second videos: specific. And increase database log-ins by Lower Six students: relevant, because it answers the problem found in the survey. By 25 per cent: measurable. A final row reminds you to check that it is achievable with the team's time, skills and resources.",
   "caption": "Read the SMART objective from top to bottom: every part answers one letter. The evaluation section must later measure the 25% target.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 410\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"620\" height=\"54\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Weak:</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"14\">Make students aware of the library.</text><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"29\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"29\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">no measure, no deadline</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">SMART:</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"104\" width=\"330\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"133.9\" font-size=\"14\">By 30 November 2026,</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"129\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"135\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">T</text><text x=\"402\" y=\"133.9\" font-size=\"14\">Time-bound: a deadline</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"166\" width=\"330\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"195.9\" font-size=\"14\">produce three 60-second videos</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"191\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"197\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">S</text><text x=\"402\" y=\"195.9\" font-size=\"14\">Specific: exact output</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"228\" width=\"330\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"249.4\" font-size=\"14\"><tspan x=\"22\">and increase database log-ins by Lower</tspan><tspan x=\"22\" dy=\"17.1\">Six students</tspan></text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"253\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"259\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">R</text><text x=\"402\" y=\"249.4\" font-size=\"14\"><tspan x=\"402\">Relevant: answers the survey</tspan><tspan x=\"402\" dy=\"17.1\">problem</tspan></text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"290\" width=\"330\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"319.9\" font-size=\"14\">by 25%.</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"315\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"321\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">M</text><text x=\"402\" y=\"319.9\" font-size=\"14\">Measurable: a target to check</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"352\" width=\"620\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"377\" r=\"18\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"383\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">A</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"383\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Then check:</text><text x=\"402\" y=\"373.4\" font-size=\"14\"><tspan x=\"402\">Achievable with your time,</tspan><tspan x=\"402\" dy=\"17.1\">skills and resources?</tspan></text></svg>"
  }
