  {
   "screen": "Implementation and Caribbean case studies",
   "title": "Figure 3.3.3 · An implementation plan, with the SargassumWatch Tobago example",
   "alt": "Five steps in a row: production plan, pilot, launch, monitoring, and maintenance and scaling. Under each step is what happened in the SargassumWatch Tobago case. Production plan: students plan a simple web map for beach photos. Pilot: a trial with two schools showed people uploaded photos without locations. A dashed arrow loops back to the plan: an automatic GPS tag was added. Launch: published for residents. Monitoring: the map helps beach clean-up volunteers plan their weekends. Maintenance and scaling: update the map and adapt it for other islands.",
   "caption": "The pilot is the cheapest place to find a problem. SargassumWatch fixed the missing locations before the full launch.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 320\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M3U3-3-agold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker><marker id=\"M3U3-3-aink\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" class=\"f-ink\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"6\" y=\"58\" width=\"116\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"84.2\" font-size=\"14.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"64\">Production</tspan><tspan x=\"64\" dy=\"17.7\">plan</tspan></text><line x1=\"123\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"88\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U3-3-agold)\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"136\" width=\"116\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"192.5\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"64\">web map for</tspan><tspan x=\"64\" dy=\"16.5\">beach photos</tspan></text><rect x=\"133\" y=\"58\" width=\"116\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"93.1\" font-size=\"14.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Pilot</text><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"259\" y2=\"88\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U3-3-agold)\"/><rect x=\"133\" y=\"136\" width=\"116\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"184.3\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"191\">two schools:</tspan><tspan x=\"191\" dy=\"16.5\">photos had</tspan><tspan x=\"191\" dy=\"16.5\">no locations</tspan></text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"58\" width=\"116\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"93.1\" font-size=\"14.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Launch</text><line x1=\"377\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"386\" y2=\"88\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U3-3-agold)\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"136\" width=\"116\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"192.5\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"318\">published for</tspan><tspan x=\"318\" dy=\"16.5\">residents</tspan></text><rect x=\"387\" y=\"58\" width=\"116\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"445\" y=\"93.1\" font-size=\"14.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Monitoring</text><line x1=\"504\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"513\" y2=\"88\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U3-3-agold)\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"136\" width=\"116\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"445\" y=\"184.3\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"445\">volunteers</tspan><tspan x=\"445\" dy=\"16.5\">use it to plan</tspan><tspan x=\"445\" dy=\"16.5\">clean-ups</tspan></text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"58\" width=\"116\" height=\"60\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"572\" y=\"84.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"572\">Maintenance</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"15.9\">and scaling</tspan></text><rect x=\"514\" y=\"136\" width=\"116\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"572\" y=\"184.3\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><tspan x=\"572\">update it;</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"16.5\">adapt for</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"16.5\">other islands</tspan></text><path d=\"M197,58 C197,14 64,14 64,54\" class=\"f-none s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U3-3-aink)\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">fix: automatic GPS tag</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"13.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Case: SargassumWatch Tobago. Pilot first, then launch.</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"306\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Lower boxes: what happened at each step</text></svg>"
  }
