  {
   "screen": "Evaluating utility: a decision matrix",
   "title": "Figure 3.5.2 · The weighted decision matrix, cell by cell",
   "alt": "The decision matrix for Montserrat Volcano Tours, which needs five 30-second vertical videos with no software budget, mid-range laptops and a two-week deadline. Each cell shows score times weight equals points, with a bar for the points. Cost, weight 3: Premiere Pro 1 times 3 equals 3, DaVinci Resolve 5 times 3 equals 15, CapCut 4 times 3 equals 12. Ease of use and speed, weight 3: 3 times 3 equals 9, 2 times 3 equals 6, 5 times 3 equals 15. Features for vertical social clips, weight 2: 4 times 2 equals 8, 4 times 2 equals 8, 5 times 2 equals 10. Technical requirements on mid-range laptops, weight 2: 3 times 2 equals 6, 2 times 2 equals 4, 4 times 2 equals 8. Privacy and terms of use, weight 1: 4, 4 and 3. Totals out of a possible 55: Premiere Pro 30, DaVinci Resolve 37, CapCut 48. CapCut has the greatest utility for this project.",
   "caption": "Multiply each score by its weight, then add. A heavy weight (3) makes a criterion count three times as much as a light one (1). The winner is only the best tool for this job.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 450\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><text x=\"320\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Montserrat Volcano Tours: five 30-second Reels, no budget, two weeks</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Each cell: score (1 poor to 5 excellent) × weight = points</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">Criterion (weight)</text><text x=\"318\" y=\"77.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">Premiere Pro</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"69.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"442\">DaVinci</tspan><tspan x=\"442\" dy=\"15.9\">Resolve (free)</tspan></text><text x=\"566\" y=\"69.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"566\">CapCut</tspan><tspan x=\"566\" dy=\"15.9\">(desktop)</tspan></text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"94\" width=\"620\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"121.7\" font-size=\"13.5\">Cost (3)</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\">1 × 3 = 3</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"120\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">5 × 3 = 15</text><rect x=\"386\" y=\"120\" width=\"105\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\">4 × 3 = 12</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"120\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"144\" width=\"620\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"171.7\" font-size=\"13.5\">Ease of use / speed (3)</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\">3 × 3 = 9</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"170\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\">2 × 3 = 6</text><rect x=\"386\" y=\"170\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">5 × 3 = 15</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"170\" width=\"105\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"194\" width=\"620\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"213.5\" font-size=\"13.5\"><tspan x=\"18\">Features for vertical social clips</tspan><tspan x=\"18\" dy=\"16.5\">(2)</tspan></text><text x=\"262\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"13\">4 × 2 = 8</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"220\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"13\">4 × 2 = 8</text><rect x=\"386\" y=\"220\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">5 × 2 = 10</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"220\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"244\" width=\"620\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-none s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"263.5\" font-size=\"13.5\"><tspan x=\"18\">Technical requirements on</tspan><tspan x=\"18\" dy=\"16.5\">mid-range laptops (2)</tspan></text><text x=\"262\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"13\">3 × 2 = 6</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"270\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"13\">2 × 2 = 4</text><rect x=\"386\" y=\"270\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">4 × 2 = 8</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"270\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"294\" width=\"620\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"321.7\" font-size=\"13.5\">Privacy and terms of use (1)</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">4 × 1 = 4</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"320\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">4 × 1 = 4</text><rect x=\"386\" y=\"320\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\">3 × 1 = 3</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"320\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"348\" width=\"620\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"381.9\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Total (out of 55)</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"380\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"386\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\">37</text><rect x=\"386\" y=\"380\" width=\"77.7\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\">48</text><rect x=\"510\" y=\"380\" width=\"100.8\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"424\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\">CapCut (48) has the greatest utility for this project.</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"446\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">For a 20-minute documentary with careful colour grading, Resolve might win.</text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Core image-editing concepts in any editor",
   "title": "Figure 3.5.3 · A layered working file, pulled apart",
   "alt": "An exploded view of four layers in a working file for a sea-moss jar advert, from top to bottom. Text layer: the title stays editable. Adjustment layer: changes brightness and colour of the layers below while the original pixels stay untouched. Product layer with a mask: the mask hides everything except the jar without deleting any pixels. Background photo layer: a beach with sea, sky and sun. A note explains blend modes: multiply darkens, screen lightens and overlay boosts contrast. An arrow leads from the layered working file, saved as PSD, AFPHOTO or XCF, to the export, a single flattened JPEG or PNG.",
   "caption": "Every layer can still be changed because nothing has been painted onto the photo itself. Keep the layered master and export a flattened copy.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 474\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M3U5-3-agold\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8.5\" refY=\"5\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"11\" markerHeight=\"11\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,1 L10,5 L0,9 z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"16\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Working file (PSD, AFPHOTO or XCF): every layer stays separate</text><polygon points=\"86,44 306,44 236,104 16,104\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"86,44 306,44 236,104 16,104\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><polygon points=\"112.7,64 140.7,64 119.7,82 91.7,82\" class=\"f-gold\"/><polygon points=\"148.7,64 170.7,64 149.7,82 127.7,82\" class=\"f-gold\"/><polygon points=\"178.7,64 208.7,64 187.7,82 157.7,82\" class=\"f-gold\"/><polygon points=\"216.7,64 242.7,64 221.7,82 195.7,82\" class=\"f-gold\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"74\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"74\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Text layer</text><text x=\"336\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">the title stays editable</text><polygon points=\"86,116 306,116 236,176 16,176\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"86,116 306,116 236,176 16,176\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><circle cx=\"161\" cy=\"146\" r=\"14\" class=\"f-surface s-ink\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M161,132 A14,14 0 0 1 161,160 z\" class=\"f-ink\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"146\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Adjustment layer</text><text x=\"336\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"336\">changes brightness and colour of the</tspan><tspan x=\"336\" dy=\"15.6\">layers below; original pixels untouched</tspan></text><polygon points=\"86,188 306,188 236,248 16,248\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"86,188 306,188 236,248 16,248\" class=\"f-none s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><polygon points=\"163.7,202 195.7,202 151.3,240 119.3,240\" class=\"f-muted\"/><polygon points=\"169,194 209,194 199.7,202 159.7,202\" class=\"f-gold\"/><polygon points=\"153.7,214 177.7,214 161.3,228 137.3,228\" class=\"f-surface\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"218\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"218\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Product layer + mask</text><text x=\"336\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"336\">the mask hides all but the jar, without</tspan><tspan x=\"336\" dy=\"15.6\">deleting pixels</tspan></text><polygon points=\"86,260 306,260 236,320 16,320\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"44,296 264,296 236,320 16,320\" class=\"f-soft\"/><polygon points=\"247.3,276 240.7,280.5 233.2,283.8 226.8,285 223.2,283.8 223.4,280.5 227.3,276 233.9,271.5 241.4,268.2 247.8,267 251.4,268.2 251.2,271.5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><polygon points=\"86,260 306,260 236,320 16,320\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"290\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"290\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Background layer</text><text x=\"336\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">the beach photo</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"326\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"356\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M3U5-3-agold)\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"358\" width=\"220\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"377.6\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"140\">Export: one flattened</tspan><tspan x=\"140\" dy=\"15.9\">JPEG or PNG</tspan></text><rect x=\"266\" y=\"350\" width=\"364\" height=\"116\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"372\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Blend modes</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">decide how a layer mixes with what is below</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"412\" font-size=\"13\">Multiply darkens (shadows, textures)</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"431\" font-size=\"13\">Screen lightens (glows, light leaks)</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"13\">Overlay boosts contrast</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"424\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">Keep the layered master</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"441\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"f-muted\">as proof of your process</text></svg>"
  }
